mcpi-python-client
===================

Lightweight mcpi-compatible Python client (skeleton) that talks JSON-Lines over TCP.

Default host/port: `127.0.0.1:4712`.

Install (dev):

```bash
python -m pip install -e python
```

Run example:

```bash
python python/examples/hello_post.py
```
